{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1238356578"}, "name":{"label":"Dolphquin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-21T19:46:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.9"}, "id":{"label":"14091459810"}, "title":{"label":"Love this app! Please add more free reoccurring tasks! + add a new feature"}, "content":{"label":"I love how aesthetic, simple, and customizable this planner is! I use it all the time and I can’t get over how most of it is free. \nIf you want more icons for tasks and reoccurring tasks you have to get the membership but I use the free one it’s enough. \nHowever, i think there should be more free reoccurring tasks, like 2 or 3 rather than just the waking up one. I like to put school on it and it’s annoying to do it everyday. \nI also think it would be cool if you could enable where the tasks automatically completes after the time to complete it end. It would be easier than manually going in to check everything and would be completely optional for those who want it. I’m not someone who can complete a task and then check it off on my phone or I’ll get distracted, so this would really help and feel more like I’m completing them as I go rather than just  checking them all off at the end of the day. I also think it would be cool if there is a workout feature! Just a random idea that you could maybe add in the future. Or more font options.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
