{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1042880602"}, "name":{"label":"43644binx"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-19T07:41:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.9"}, "id":{"label":"14082251497"}, "title":{"label":"OBSESSED"}, "content":{"label":"I have ADHD -structured planning is NOT an easy task for me. I don’t always follow my schedule exactly but this app is so easy to use and has so many accessible features that it’s now a necessity for me. I love that I’m able to sync my schedule across my devices to help remind me what task I should be focused on. And it feels pressure free. It’s there when I need to use it. I’m still working to create more structure in my life, but the task is less daunting with this app. Shoutout to its creators for literally changing lives lol", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
