{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id918369821"}, "name":{"label":"yes?hello?"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-16T22:29:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.9"}, "id":{"label":"14073577652"}, "title":{"label":"Why?"}, "content":{"label":"My new rating: bad app, everything is paid now. I thought I had already bought the lifetime, nope, need to pay another 30$. I can finally delete this app knowing it’s not useful. \n\nThis was my old rating, which had been saved from previous and not posted (thankfully because this app now sucks and doesn’t deserve this rating): The Premium is one-time and super affordable! This app has helped me keep track of this semester. I just wish there was an option to see the entire calendar at once with all of my events!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id49830014"}, "name":{"label":"Big And Tasty"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-15T06:01:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.9"}, "id":{"label":"14067087866"}, "title":{"label":"You have made some terrible UI choices."}, "content":{"label":"Are you guys have made some terrible design choices:\n\n1) The continue button on the ad task modal looks disabled because of the lack of contrast between the button styling and the rest of the text on page.\n\n2) The time picker is very frustrating. There's no way to go from nine in the morning to five in the afternoon without having to click 10+ times. No dragging on the time picker is very limiting.\n\nProbably going to switch to another task app specifically because of these two issues.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id423777276"}, "name":{"label":"Pup love2468"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-14T20:41:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.9"}, "id":{"label":"14065788999"}, "title":{"label":"Used to be amazing."}, "content":{"label":"This is the first time I am reviewing an app for how it has disappointed me. This tool used to be very helpful to me when I was in a difficult time of my life but now the updates have whipped my schedule entirely and has become difficult to use without using the Ai tool. I paid for a lifetime subscription for this app because I believed it would help me and the developers earned that. I no longer believe that to be true. I am so sad my app has functionally reset. I will not delete it because I paid for it but if I cared less for that 100 some-odd dollars, I would.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
